    <string-array name="about_rules">
        <item>Each question gives you 15 seconds to answer — running out of time counts as a wrong answer.</item>
        <item>Once you pick an answer it locks in immediately, then the correct one is revealed before the next question.</item>
        <item>In Duo mode, players take turns answering one question at a time.</item>
        <item>Your best score is tracked separately for each quiz length, and only a higher score replaces it.</item>
        <item>High scores are only recorded in Solo mode.</item>
        <item>Pick one or more topics before starting — the questions from all of them are shuffled together.</item>
